[Demo]
<h2>~mThe Supreme Ruler</h2>
<be><i>~yOmnia sunt miseria in bellis civilibus, sed miserius nihil quam ipsa victoria
-- Cicero<br></i>
<p>
The final battle is at hand, you know, if you and your ally win this, chaos will be erradicated from the world of <i>~lNimbus</i>, and peace will be restored to the world.
$Button=More,Tell,More

[More]
No info available....
The only rule is: kill,crush and sacrifice.
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Start - and end,DoNothing,0
$Button=Bai,Tell,Bail

[Bail]
Do you wish to retreat from your fianl battle, now, when all seems to be on your side?
$Button=Quit,MissionAbort,1
$Button=Resume Game,DoNothing,0

[@60]
<h2>~gA message from your ally:</h2>
<br>Master, I feel, that luck is on our side. We'll win this <i>~rWAR</i>!!!
$Button=O.K.,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gThe master of the Chidory sends you a message:</h2>
<br>Good work master, now let's sacrifice this infidel, once and for all!
$Button=Consider it done,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gA message from your ally:</h2>
<br>Nice catch, but don't throw this one back into the sea!!
$Button=Don't worry,DoNothing,0

[ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>~rA message from the enemy:</h2>
<br>Looks like it's the end for your little ally...
$Button=Don't count your chickens before they're hatched!,Tell,RSQ

[RSQ]
~gMaster, save me!!! I don't want to end up on the sacrificial altar.....
$Button=Help is on the way,DoNothing,0
$Button=I can't,Tell,No
$Button=Are you crazy,DoNothing,0

[No]
~gMaster, it's been good knowing such a good ally, and a true friend.....
Just promise me you'll win this <i>~rWAR</i>, and avenge my death!
$Button=I promise,DoNothing,0

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gBring that insolante fool to my Altar, I want to be the one who'll spill his unholy blood!
$Button=O.K.,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>~lVICTORY!</h2>
<br>The clouds started lifting since you've defeated the <i>~Priests of Chaos</i>. Peace is restored to the people of <i>~lNIMBUS</i>.
<br>Your ally sned you a message:
$Button=Read,Tell,Read

[Read]
<h2>Hail to you ~mCHAMPION!</h2>
You've brought peace to this world master, the people idolize you as a GOD, I think that even the <i>~yFuries</i> themselves admire your courage and leadership.
ANd I am proud to call you <i>~gFRIEND</i>!
$Button=Thanks,MissionAbort,1

[Failed]
<h2>~rYou've failed to achieve victory</h2>
<br>The enemy is victorious, your ally's blood is dripping from the enemies altar, looks like <i>~yPeace</i> was only a <i>~lfools dream</i>...
$Button=Retry mission,MissionBegin,TheGreatBattle
$Button=I've had enough!,MissionAbort,1

[End] 